WEBVTT

00:00:00.183 --> 00:00:01.039
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:01.881 --> 00:00:05.350
<v><b>A:</b></v> I was wondering if you were thinking of helping with dinner tonight?

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:10.336
<v><b>B:</b></v> Me? Terribly sorry, I’ve promised to have a game of tennis with Adam.

00:00:12.138 --> 00:00:12.818
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:13.707 --> 00:00:15.987
<v><b>C:</b></v> So, I’m sitting at this café

00:00:15.987 --> 00:00:20.172
and a really good- looking waiter asks me what I want to drink, and…

00:00:20.172 --> 00:00:23.451
<v><b>A:</b></v> Sorry, but isn’t that your daughter crying?

00:00:23.476 --> 00:00:26.150
<v><b>C:</b></v> …and he says ‘You look as if you need company…’

00:00:27.959 --> 00:00:28.769
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:29.308 --> 00:00:34.039
<v><b>A:</b></v> OK, kids, it’s time you went to bed. Put away the toys and off you go.

00:00:34.039 --> 00:00:38.265
<v><b>D:</b></v> Actually, if you don’t mind, I’d rather you didn’t speak to Alfie like that.

00:00:38.265 --> 00:00:40.675
We think he needs to make his own decisions.